  (text "CHECK BEFORE LAYOUT: RESV pins (2, 3, 7, 10, 11) and INT2/FSYNC (9) are left unconnected here; confirm against the datasheet. Confirm the LGA footprint pad order." (at 30 29 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 3fa6a77a-d0be-4a99-8959-ee9513a6b5a2))
